  "body": "This is your opportunity to secure a stylish, low-maintenance home in the heart of Stanmore Bay - and the vendor is highly motivated and ready to meet the market.\r\n\r\nSpread across three well-designed levels, this contemporary townhouse offers 3 spacious bedrooms and 3 modern bathrooms, ideal for families, professionals, or investors seeking strong rental appeal.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n3 generous bedrooms, including a large master retreat\r\n3 sleek, fully tiled bathrooms - no morning queues\r\nOpen-plan kitchen, dining & living flowing to a sunny deck\r\nEasy-care outdoor space - perfect for entertaining\r\nInternal access garage + additional storage\r\nNear-new build with modern finishes throughout\r\n\r\nLocated in a growing and family-friendly neighborhood, you're just minutes from:\r\nStanmore Bay School\r\nShops, cafés & local amenities\r\nBeautiful beaches & Gulf Harbour\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer, downsizer, or investor, this property ticks all the boxes.\r\n\r\nVENDOR INSTRUCTIONS ARE CLEAR - THIS PROPERTY MUST BE SOLD!\r\n\r\nAct fast - opportunities like this don't last long.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing or visit the next open home.",
